OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fwith some bright spells at first.
OL,7,FPatchy rain spreading north through
OL,8,Fthe evening, becoming heavier at times
OL,9,Fovernight but staying mostly dry in
OL,10,Fthe east. Strengthening southerly
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FCloudy and windy with some
OL,14,Fshowery outbreaks of rain spreading
OL,15,Feast, the rain heavy at times. Gales
OL,16,Fdeveloping during the day, easing
OL,17,Fsomewhat in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
