OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FBright
OL,6,Fstart Monday, then becoming windy with
OL,7,Fgales and occasionally heavy rain or
OL,8,Fshowers, this persisting through
OL,9,FTuesday. Rain and strong winds
OL,10,Fclearing early Wednesday, dry with
OL,11,Fbright spells later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
